# Benchmark: Logic & Flow (LG-01 to LG-04)

[A] IN-01 1 @0,0
[B] IN-01 100 @0,100
[C] IN-01 0 @0,200

[Gate_AND] LG-01 AND @300,100
A.a -> Gate_AND.a
C.a -> Gate_AND.b

[Switch] LG-02 @600,300
Gate_AND.a -> Switch.a
A.a -> Switch.b
B.a -> Switch.c

[V_True] IN-05 Sticky, true @450,450
[V_Data] IN-01 500 @450,550
[Split] LG-03 @550,500
V_True.a -> Split.a
V_Data.a -> Split.b

# Results
[Res_Gate] OT-01 @900,100
Gate_AND.a -> Res_Gate.a

[Res_Switch] OT-01 @900,300
Switch.a -> Res_Switch.a

[Res_TrueArr] OT-01 @900,500
Split.a -> Res_TrueArr.a
